        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Capricorn &mdash; 2nd Technique, gained at level 6.</em></p><p><em>Shura's leap &mdash; he crosses the distance and the blade arrives before he does.</em></p><p><strong>Stride up to twice your Speed</strong>, ignoring difficult terrain and crossing gaps up to 20 feet as though on solid ground. This movement does not trigger reactions.</p><p>At any point during the movement, make one unarmed Strike dealing an additional @Damage[3d8[slashing]] damage. If you moved at least 20 feet before the Strike, treat the target's AC as <strong>2 lower</strong>.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightening (+2 levels)</strong> The additional damage increases by 1d8.</p><p>On a day your constellation is <strong>Ascendant</strong> this Technique heightens as though you were 4 levels higher; on a <strong>Zenith</strong>, 8 levels higher.</p>"
